      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-06-10T18:07:31Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`$(PRODUCT_OUT)` is not guaranateed to be accurate either.  This is probably fine for now, but I think long term you\u0027ll need `android.InstallPathToOnDevicePath` for device modules.  We can add something similar for host modules if necessary.",
      "parentUuid": "f81a1b4c_18442e1b",
      "revId": "c5ca4c844cd78855b41dd3e0a7436c9954997fb8",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
